        "physical_scope": "Infinite/fully developed channel or pipe ansatz with the stated regularity; exact stationary Navier–Stokes and Stokes solutions for every parameter choice in the Statement, without a small-inertia approximation; uniqueness only within the stated ansätze. Worked example is the actual explicit field/parameter selection in that section. B leaf cannot supply any later item.",
